  "configuration": "Bounded customer-neutral off-limits and exact internal-ID exclusions only, not tag/category expressions, customer lists/default assets, priority/multi-position policy or full W20/F28/F26 acceptance. Existing lifecycle/window/stock and slot-type gates, valid-pin reservation, default-arm eligible catalog order and soft diversity remain. Empty engine output hands control to the customer's existing default; no fallback asset selected. Legacy slot documents remain readable with formerly unknown controls stripped; new canonical documents carry governanceVersion:1 and new receipts independently mark slot-gates-v1. Old binaries may silently strip/ignore controls: reader/worker and UI rollout must precede controlled publications; no mixed-binary safety claim. Existing 30-second cache and non-atomic legacy slot publication remain; no immediate-effect/native/SLO guarantee. Unreadable or absent service slot config now yields no selections rather than compiled slots. API authoring defaults are not serving authority. No deployment, cloud mutation, build/install/provision/seed, credentials/customer records, destructive operations, commit/push or external actions. W19.02/W20.02 prior exact-byte assurance is prospectively qualified with implementation/history retained; W08.04 remains unchanged. No package/finding/gate/release promotion.",
